    "narrative": "The Austin Waves head into today\u2019s slate with **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** and **Gunnar Henderson** anchoring the lineup as the clear statistical leaders. **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** (81.21) benefits from a favorable matchup against Anthony Kay, with park factors and SP vulnerability pushing his ceiling higher. Similarly, **Gunnar Henderson** (80.37) is poised for a massive day against Peter Lambert; his dynamic platoon advantage (+14%) and top-of-the-order security make him a primary engine for our Roto categories today. **Jackson Merrill** (75.27) and **Drake Baldwin** (70.50) also project as strong starts, with **Jackson Merrill** providing essential coverage in the SB category despite the modest discount for elite defensive positioning.\n\nStrategic optimization was particularly difficult regarding our middle infield and utility spots. **Miguel Vargas** was the most difficult exclusion from the starting nine; while his 0.401 xwOBA is elite, his projected #3 spot against Spencer Miles didn't provide the same aggregate floor as the current starters. We opted to prioritize the high-upside speed profiles of players like **Nasim Nunez** and **Sam Antonacci** to satisfy our aggressive approach to the SB category, even though **Nasim Nunez** carries a penalty for a lower lineup slot. Conversely, **Drake Baldwin** and **Dominic Smith** face a 32% rain risk in their respective matchups against Cal Quantrill. While we are currently starting them based on their strong efficiency scores, we will monitor weather alerts closely to ensure we don't face mid-game suspensions that could compromise our weekly Roto counts.",
